    "detailed_description": "A dark massively-multiplayer online world inspired by the horror writings of H. P. Lovecraft and Robert W. Chambers!<br><br>\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u200a<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1149400/extras/7f11e372fd4011daf82de80316aa268a.poster.avif?t=1593111090\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1149400/extras/7f11e372fd4011daf82de80316aa268a.webm?t=1593111090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1149400/extras/7f11e372fd4011daf82de80316aa268a.mp4?t=1593111090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800<br>\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800<br>Delve into infinite dungeons with hundreds of other players to discover secret treasure, ingenious traps, unspeakable monstrosities, roguelike puzzles, and a complex combat system.<br><br>Adventurers looking for more can also battle in Player vs Player arenas, advance the leaderboards, create a guild, and hunt down thousands of collectible vanity items.<br><br>\u200a<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1149400/extras/81e3b1a5a56cced79913f3fab5ccc963.poster.avif?t=1593111090\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1149400/extras/81e3b1a5a56cced79913f3fab5ccc963.webm?t=1593111090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1149400/extras/81e3b1a5a56cced79913f3fab5ccc963.mp4?t=1593111090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>You are invited to participate in continuous development of the game, with your feedback guiding the evoluti